WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:06.720
Almost since day one, I've been telling you
that we are dealing with an actual virus that

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:12.570
spreads virally, but we are also dealing with
disinformation that's spreading virally and

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:18.380
ignorance that is spreading virally. And this
came to a head over the weekend with protests,

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:23.730
protests of huge groups of people crowded
together, mostly without masks, demanding

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:30.050
that their states be fully opened in the middle
of a viral pandemic. And they are almost exclusively

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:34.840
Trump supporters, not all, but mostly. Donald
Trump has actually started to be supportive

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:38.920
of them on Twitter and during press briefings.
We'll get to that a little bit later. And

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:43.260
these are quite simply actions that are going
to spread the virus and lead to more deaths.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:49.370
We're now starting to see the results of Wisconsin
voting in person. And we're seeing spiked

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:54.480
infections in Wisconsin. It takes 10 to 14
days to see that. And we are now seeing it.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.280
And much the same is going to happen here.
